  <section id="capabilities" class="section capabilities reveal"><div class="section-intro"><p class="kicker"><span></span> WHAT WE DO</p><h2>From first line<br>to <em>full flight.</em></h2><p>One focused partner for learning technology, launching careers, and building the digital systems that make businesses sharper.</p></div><div class="capability-list"><article><span class="cap-number">01</span><div><i class="bi bi-braces"></i><h3>Product engineering</h3><p>Websites, platforms, dashboards, and software made around the way your team actually works.</p><a href="#contact">See how we build <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></article><article><span class="cap-number">02</span><div><i class="bi bi-layers"></i><h3>Career acceleration</h3><p>Hands-on internships and courses that replace passive learning with projects, feedback, and proof.</p><a href="#internship">Find your program <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></article><article><span class="cap-number">03</span><div><i class="bi bi-people"></i><h3>Team enablement</h3><p>Practical corporate training that gets your people fluent in modern tools and better ways of working.</p><a href="#enquiry">Train your team <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></article></div></section>
