  <section id="enquiry" class="section enquiry reveal"><div class="enquiry-copy"><p class="kicker light"><span></span> LET'S MAKE A START</p><h2>Have a question?<br><em>Good.</em></h2><p>Tell us where you are trying to go. We will help you find the clearest next step.</p><div class="contact-chip"><i class="bi bi-chat-square-text"></i><span><b>Usually replies within a day</b><small>+91 83080 35049</small></span></div></div><form class="form-card" action="/enquiry" method="post"><h3>Start here.</h3><label>Full name<input name="fullName" required placeholder="Your name"></label><div class="form-row"><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>Phone<input name="phone" required placeholder="+91 83080 35049"></label></div><label>Preferred domain<select name="domain"><option>Full Stack Development</option><option>Web Development</option><option>App Development</option><option>Data Science</option><option>AI & Machine Learning</option><option>Data Analytics</option></select></label><fieldset><legend>I am looking for</legend><label><input type="radio" name="type" value="Course" checked> A course</label><label><input type="radio" name="type" value="Internship"> An internship</label><label><input type="radio" name="type" value="Corporate Training"> Team training</label></fieldset><button class="btn btn-acid" type="submit">Send enquiry <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></button></form></section>
  <section id="contact" class="section contact reveal"><div><p class="kicker"><span></span> FIND US</p><h2>Let's build<br><em>what's next.</em></h2><p>For consultations, internships, and corporate learning, our door is open.</p></div><div class="contact-details"><p><i class="bi bi-telephone"></i><span>+91 83080 35049</span></p><p><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i><span>Info@jdsolutionss.com</span></p><p><i class="bi bi-geo-alt"></i><span>Rainbow Crossroad, Wagholi, Pune</span></p><a class="under-link dark-link" href="mailto:Info@jdsolutionss.com">Write to us <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></section>
